WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.303 --> 00:00:04.803
It's a beautiful day
for a joust.

00:00:04.903 --> 00:00:05.805
Indeed.

00:00:05.905 --> 00:00:08.007
Sun's out,
got my lucky loincloth,

00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:09.909
cold Bud Light, comfy throne.

00:00:10.009 --> 00:00:11.677
I don't have the plague anymore.

00:00:11.744 --> 00:00:13.213
Look! It's the Bud Knight.

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:14.747
Dilly, dilly!

00:00:14.847 --> 00:00:15.715
Dilly, dilly!

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:17.383
You! Hold my beer.

00:00:17.883 --> 00:00:19.486
You... hold my other beer.

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:21.388
Whoops.

00:00:21.988 --> 00:00:23.189
One more.

00:00:24.123 --> 00:00:26.359
All right! Let's tap this keg.

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.671
Giddy-up, Peanut!

